{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>Only in the water of impurity shall it be purified.</b> It would seem to us that it is the water of the cow's ashes, like 'the water of impurity was not sprinkled on him.' And the Sages, of blessed memory, said that its meaning concerns the quantity of water in which the menstruating woman bathes, and their knowledge is broader than ours."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:19:58.555632391Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}